First release of RME Bayan: medical records on board.
• Nurses: register patients, record complaints & vital signs
• Doctors: examine patients, add ICD-10 diagnoses & prescriptions
• Pharmacy: dispense prescriptions, track medicine stock
• Lab: send lab results to the doctor
• Coordinators: set clinic schedules & adjust medicine stock
• Ship admin: log fuel, fresh water & trip issues
• Works offline, syncs when back online
• Notifications for new patients, prescriptions & lab results
